            <table width="543" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                    <td width="543" class="pageName">
                        <p class="style77">ICSE DUPLICATE SUBMISSION STATEMENT</p>
                        <p class="bodyText">Below is the statement about duplicate submissions that was agreed to at the
                            ICSE steering committee held in Charleston, South Carolina at FSE-10 in November 2002. It is
                            highly recommend that this statement be included in the CFP and on the web page of all
                            future ICSE conferences.</p>
                        <p class="style77">Duplicate Submissions</p>
                        <p class="bodyText">A paper submitted to an International Conference on Software Engineering
                            (ICSE)<span class="style40">&#174;</span> will be considered to be a duplicate submission
                            and rejected by that conference with no regard to the paper's scientific merit if there is
                            substantial overlap in the technical content of the conference submission and any other work
                            that is:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li class="bodyText">under review at another publication,</li>
                            <li class="bodyText">has been accepted by another publication, or</li>
                            <li class="bodyText">has appeared in another publication, at any time before the conference
                                review process is complete.
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="bodyText">In this context, a &quot;publication&quot; is any peer-reviewed scientific
                            archive such as a conference, journal, or technical book. The determination of <strong>substantial
                                overlap in the technical content</strong> will be made by the program committee chairs.
                        </p>
                        <p class="bodyText">&nbsp;</p>
                        <p>&nbsp;</p></td>
